      "role": "user",
      "content": "I appreciate the commitment to transparency. I'm holding off on the paperwork until I hear back from you. Please be thorough—I'm particularly interested in any tickets from the last 60 days involving the units directly above the penthouse. I don't want a sanitized version; if there was a leak, even if it's been \"fixed,\" I need to know. I'll wait for your report.",
